# FastAPI Best Practices

## Project priorities
- Proper-Professional Python practices
- Simplicity
- Maintainability
- Readability.
- Always prefer Pydantic conventions.

## Project Structure
- Use proper and professional directory structure
- Implement proper and professional module organization
- Use proper and professional dependency injection
- Keep routes organized by domain
- Implement proper and professional middleware
- Use proper and professional configuration management

## API Design
- Use proper HTTP methods
- Implement proper status codes
- Use proper request/response models
- Implement proper and professional validation
- Use proper error handling
- Document APIs with OpenAPI
## Models
- Use Pydantic models, always prefer Pydantic conventions
- Implement proper validation
- Use proper type hints
- Keep models organized
- Use proper inheritance
- Implement proper serialization

## Database
- Use proper ORM (SQLAlchemy)
- Implement proper migrations
- Use proper connection pooling
- Implement proper transactions
- Use proper query optimization
- Handle database errors properly

## Authentication
- Implement proper JWT authentication
- Use proper password hashing
- Implement proper role-based access
- Use proper session management
- Implement proper OAuth2
- Handle authentication errors properly

## Security
- Implement proper CORS
- Use proper rate limiting
- Implement proper input validation
- Use proper security headers
- Handle security errors properly
- Implement proper logging

## Performance
- Use proper caching
- Implement proper async operations
- Use proper background tasks
- Implement proper connection pooling
- Use proper query optimization
- Monitor performance metrics

## Testing
- Write proper unit tests
- Implement proper integration tests
- Use proper test fixtures
- Implement proper mocking
- Test error scenarios
- Use proper test coverage

## Deployment
- Use proper and professional Docker configuration practices
- Implement proper and professional CI/CD practices
- Use proper and professional environment variables practices
- Implement proper and professional logging
- Use proper and professional monitoring
- Handle deployment errors properly and professionally

## Documentation
- Do not document the code
- This project views documentation as a maintainability blockade
- Do not add docstrings
